{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IATA: <strong>DEN</strong>, ICAO: <strong>KDEN</strong>, FAA LID: <strong>DEN</strong>\u00a0an international airport often called by locals as DIA. One of the largest airport in the Western United States area, and the second largest on Earth, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runway 16R/34L, with a length of 16,000 feet (3.03\u00a0mi; 4.88\u00a0km), is the longest public use runway in North America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579270/extras/KDEN3.jpg?t=1741778985\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One main terminal and 3 concourses that come with more than 160 gates, it is going be a busy airport to control in game, depending on the schedule you set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579270/extras/KDEN1.jpg?t=1741778985\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KDEN has its eye candy too with award-winning architecture and magnificent views of the Rocky Mountains create a unique view. Jeppesen Terminal\u2019s internationally recognized peaked roof, is reflective of snow-capped mountains and evokes the early history of Colorado, when Native American teepees dotted the Great Plains.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579270?t=1741778985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579270/2cde465079dc9f9f480a533e435b915c029d4e13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741778985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579270/d741afb124f5a04da6cbea3912ae2440f5e9b312/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741778985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579270/d741afb124f5a04da6cbea3912a